% What lesson 8's two-derivation program should say, provenance aside.
% A fact must be derived; `:- fact.` must never be, and may use variables.
%
%   python3 diagnose.py programs/two-derivations.dl --expect programs/two-derivations.expect
%   python3 mutation.py programs/two-derivations.dl --expect programs/two-derivations.expect

p(a, c).                 % two hops
q(a, c).                 % by either rule
:- p(a, b).              % one hop is not two
:- q(c, a).
